{"id":"vod_jy_32418","vodId":"32418","provider":"jy","providerName":"金鹰资源","type":2,"name":"犬夜叉","name_cn":"犬夜叉","date":"2000-01-01","year":"2000","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第167集","images":{"common":"https://image.jinyingimage.com/cover/273e78ede0ff68fcf04aa41a3dd8d36b.jpg"},"summary":"日暮戈薇是就读于国中三年级的15岁普通小女生，某日，她偶然通过家中神社的枯井来到了500年前的战国时代。时狼烟四起，妖怪横行，世间大地生灵涂炭。戈薇在御神木那里邂逅了被封印的半妖犬夜叉。50年前，意欲变成真正妖怪的犬夜叉，为了得到四魂之玉结识拥有强大灵力的巫女桔梗。经过一段时间相处，两人之间产生了感情。犬夜叉因此希望变成人类，而桔梗也打算在净化完四魂之玉后过回普通人的生活。然而，对桔梗心存邪念的盗贼鬼蜘蛛将灵魂和肉体献给妖怪，继而转生变成邪恶的半妖奈落。在他的一番挑拨下，犬夜叉被桔梗封印在神木之上，重伤的桔梗也在悲伤绝望中死去。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2022-10-17 13:26:26","playable":true,"episodeCount":167,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"jinyingm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/vbmQMNpb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/zbqYML3b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/negLQMla/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/vbmQMNAb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/zbqYM8Rb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/7axv7jnd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/6dBLREna/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/QdJq7Xlb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/0dN951Kb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/PdRo5B0e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/QbYvlX9d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/Le32KJnd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/xe7LWJGa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/negLQXla/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/vbmQMXAb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/zbqYMpRb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/7axv7znd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第18